 },
 "summary": "PH is a single-row wire-to-board system on a 2.0 mm pitch, made of a shrouded box header on the board, a PHR receptacle housing and SPH crimp contacts on the wire. Headers come in 2 to 16 circuits, top or side entry, through-hole (-K-S) or surface mount (-SM4-TB; side entry up to 15). B2B-PH-K-S is the 2-circuit top-entry through-hole header: 4.5 mm deep, 6 mm tall, 8 mm mounting height. Each contact is rated 2 A (AWG #24) and 100 V AC/DC, -40 to +105 °C.",
